WEBVTT

00:22:28.905 --> 00:22:32.001
Adrienne Boissy: You know,
we forget that culture is also a medium

00:22:32.025 --> 00:22:34.336
that bacteria and stuff grow on.

00:22:34.360 --> 00:22:36.075
AG: Adrienne Boissy is a neurologist

00:22:36.099 --> 00:22:39.200
at one of the nation's foremost
healthcare institutions,

00:22:39.224 --> 00:22:40.936
the Cleveland Clinic.

00:22:40.960 --> 00:22:44.236
Adrienne holds the title
of Chief Experience Officer.

00:22:44.260 --> 00:22:47.686
She's in charge of making sure
that patients get excellent care.

00:22:47.710 --> 00:22:49.586
And from her first days on the job,

00:22:49.610 --> 00:22:52.230
she could see that physicians
couldn't provide that care

00:22:52.254 --> 00:22:53.686
when they were burning out.

00:22:53.710 --> 00:22:55.746
She's become an expert on the topic.

00:22:55.770 --> 00:22:59.036
She spent the past decade
studying what causes burnout.

00:22:59.060 --> 00:23:02.258
AB: You heard people say,